      "versionNonce": 440379363,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786648247566,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    1.Sort by start first, sort by end if needed \n    2.How to Sort: Integer.compare(a,b) or (a,b) -> a[0] - b[0] => sort asc\n       - more complex sort \n        (a,b) -> {\n                    if(a[0] == b[0] return b[1] - b[0]\n                    else return a[0] - b[0]\n                    }\n    3.Convert to Array arrayList.toArray(new int[0][0])",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    1.Sort by start first, sort by end if needed \n    2.How to Sort: Integer.compare(a,b) or (a,b) -> a[0] - b[0] => sort asc\n       - more complex sort \n        (a,b) -> {\n                    if(a[0] == b[0] return b[1] - b[0]\n                    else return a[0] - b[0]\n                    }\n    3.Convert to Array arrayList.toArray(new int[0][0])",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
