      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786655427753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- _get_connection_pool(): get db connection pool, fallback: no pool, create a new AyncConnectionPool degraded\n- _chat(state: GraphState, config) -> process chat state and generate response\n    - return next node to execute (Command)\n        - goto = goto (toolcall, end)\n    - use prepare_messages to consolidate system prompt with user message \n    - use process_llm_response to process response\n- _tool_call(GraphState)\n    - async _execute_tool \n    - len = 1 -> await\n    - len > 1-> ayncio.gather(): async call all tools and gather once all finished \n    - Return Command (goto = \"chat\")\n- create_graph",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- _get_connection_pool(): get db connection pool, fallback: no pool, create a new AyncConnectionPool degraded\n- _chat(state: GraphState, config) -> process chat state and generate response\n    - return next node to execute (Command)\n        - goto = goto (toolcall, end)\n    - use prepare_messages to consolidate system prompt with user message \n    - use process_llm_response to process response\n- _tool_call(GraphState)\n    - async _execute_tool \n    - len = 1 -> await\n    - len > 1-> ayncio.gather(): async call all tools and gather once all finished \n    - Return Command (goto = \"chat\")\n- create_graph",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
